                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/50: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-07-19T20:00:00-04:00">July 19, 1935—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>139. From Gibson. Department’s 104, July 18, 2 p.m. Communication made today to
                    the Minister for Foreign Affairs and to those members of the Conference who have
                    mentioned the subject as coming from Saavedra Lamas.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Weddell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
